  "prefLabel": "Gen 402.07 Basis for Renewal of Licensure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 402.07 Basis for Renewal of Licensure. The OPLC shall renew the licenses of licensees who:\n\n(a) Have submitted the completed renewal application form, the renewal fee, and supporting documents required for renewal, on or before the expiration of the license;\n\n(b) Have maintained continuing competence through continuing professional education or continuing professional activity; and\n\n(c) Are of good moral and professional character, as evidenced by:\n\n(1) The answers to the questions from the application form specified in Plc 308.05; and\n\n(2) Any related documents submitted pursuant to Plc 308.06.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (formerly Gen 402.02) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35 (formerly Gen 40.10)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen400.html"
